<h2 class="section-header">Result:</h2>
<p>The program was implemented successfully to demonstrate method overriding and runtime polymorphism for different banks. The execution confirms dynamic method dispatch where the appropriate <code>interestRate()</code> method is selected and invoked at runtime based on user selection.</p>

